{"ref":"BDB, גֹּ֫רֶן","hw":"גֹּ֫רֶן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּ֫רֶן</span></big>  <strong>n.m. threshing-floor (</strong>cf. further vulg. Ar. <span dir=\"rtl\">جُرْنٌ</span> <em>stone basin, trough, mortar</em>, etc. Dozy Lane, v. Moḥiṭ<sup>243 b, 7</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּרֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:10\" href=\"/Genesis.50.10\">Gn 50:10</a> + 27 times (cstr. e.g. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:10\" href=\"/Genesis.50.10\">Gn 50:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:11\" href=\"/Genesis.50.11\">11</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.6\">2 S 6:6</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּֽרְנָֽה ׃</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:12\" href=\"/Micah.4.12\">Mi 4:12</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּרְנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 21:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.21.10\">Is 21:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּרְנְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.14\">Dt 15:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 16:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.16.13\">16:13</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגְּרָנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 23:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.23.1\">1 S 23:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגֳּרָנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:24\" href=\"/Joel.2.24\">Jo 2:24</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּרְנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:1\" href=\"/Hosea.9.1\">Ho 9:1</a>—<strong>threshing-floor</strong>, (on form. v. Rob<sup>BR i. 550</sup> cf. Fl NHWB<sup>i. 437</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:10\" href=\"/Genesis.50.10\">Gn 50:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:11\" href=\"/Genesis.50.11\">11</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(ג׳ האטד)</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:27\" href=\"/Numbers.18.27\">Nu 18:27</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(דָּגָן מן־הג׳)</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 15:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.15.14\">Dt 15:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 16:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.16.13\">16:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:37\" href=\"/Judges.6.37\">Ju 6:37</a> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:2\" href=\"/Ruth.3.2\">Ru 3:2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(הוּא זֹרֶה ג׳ הַשְּׂעֹרִים)</span> v <a data-ref=